  "title": "Auditory naming",
  "description": "Intracranial EEG recordings from 106 patients performing an auditory descriptive naming task, used to study dynamic causal tractography of auditory naming. Data are provided as EDF files with event codes for stimulus onset, stimulus offset, and response onset. Electrode coordinates are given in MNI-305 (fsaverage) space.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded from patients during an auditory naming task. Events are tagged as 401 (stimulus onset), 402 (stimulus offset), and 501 (response onset). Electrode locations were spatially normalized to the FreeSurfer standard brain space (MNI-305).",
